invariant: INV-14
file: handshake_post.h
catches: webpki_resume_test
reason: hspost_present_ticket writes a ticket over an external PSK in a
  TRUST=webpki configuration, which takes a PSK only as a ticket it bound
  itself (webpki_cfg.h). The configuration that asks for an external PSK
  then resumes the ticket in silence. The row that presents a ticket
  beside an external PSK requires CH_EINVAL.

--- old
#ifdef CH_TRUST_WEBPKI
    if (cfg->psk != NULL || cfg->psk_len != 0 || cfg->psk_id != NULL || cfg->psk_id_len != 0) {
        return 0;
    }
#endif
--- new
#ifdef CH_TRUST_WEBPKI
#endif
